<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (showPriorityQueue\(\) creates indexArr[MAX_PATIENTS], fills it with patient indices, and bubble-sorts the indices according to triageLevel in descending order. The patient arrays themselves are not rearranged. Because equal triage levels are not swapped, patients with the same urgency retain their registration order, satisfying the assignment's secondary priority rule.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [36]
>>
