360 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (The additional five-page reference report supplied for this project uses a similar report organization: high-level architecture, function list, data structures, file persistence and system assumptions. Its discussion of structs was not copied into this report because the current source code uses parallel arrays. Likewise, reference-only functions such as resetSystem\(\), displayMenu\(\), assignBed\(\), calculateGrossTotal\(\), calculateFinalAmount\(\), formatCurrency\(\), printBill\(\), saveData\(\)/loadData\(\) and savePatientRecord\(\) are not listed as implemented functions here because they do not exist in the supplied current source.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
