362 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 96 0 R
/E (Transitioning from fixed-size parallel arrays to linked lists \(malloc/free\) to allow unlimited patient capacity. Graphical User Interface \(GUI\): Upgrading from a console interface to a desktop GUI \(e.g., using GTK or Win32 API\) for improved usability. Database Integration: Replacing text file storage \(.txt\) with an SQL database \(e.g., SQLite\) for structured querying and data encryption. Role-Based Access Control: Implementing multi-user login mechanisms for Doctors, Administrative Staff, and Pharmacists with restricted access levels)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
