/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 97 0 R
/T (The Smart Hospital & Resource Allocation System implements the core CSC 1012 requirements through a modular C program. It combines patient intake, emergency triage, specialty waiting-time estimation, automatic bed allocation, billing, priority sorting, performance reporting and text-file persistence in a single console-based workflow.)
/E (The Smart Hospital & Resource Allocation System implements the core CSC 1012 requirements through a modular C program. It combines patient intake, emergency triage, specialty waiting-time estimation, automatic bed allocation, billing, priority sorting, performance reporting and text-file persistence in a single console-based workflow.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
