/T (The main documented limitations are the fixed 100-patient in-memory capacity, current-session-only patient analytics, append-only historical billing records, and the absence of enforcement for the configured specialty daily-cap values. These limitations are stated explicitly so that the report represents the current source code accurately.)
/E (The main documented limitations are the fixed 100-patient in-memory capacity, current-session-only patient analytics, append-only historical billing records, and the absence of enforcement for the configured specialty daily-cap values. These limitations are stated explicitly so that the report represents the current source code accurately.)
/Pg 25 0 R
