621 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Smart Hospital & Resource Allocation System implements the core CSC 1012 requirements through a modular C program. It combines patient intake, emergency triage, specialty waiting-time estimation, automatic bed allocation, billing, priority sorting, performance reporting and text-file persistence in a single console-based workflow.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 30 0 R
/Next 881 0 R
>>
endobj
622 0 obj
<<
/Title (The main documented limitations are the fixed 100-patient in-memory capacity, current-session-only patient analytics, append-only historical billing records, and the absence of enforcement for the configured specialty daily-cap values. These limitations are stated explicitly so that the report represents the current source code accurately.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 30 0 R
/Prev 881 0 R
>>
endobj
