<<
/Title (THE REGISTRATION PROCESS FIRST VALIDATES THE MAXIMUM PATIENT CAPACITY, THEN COLLECTS NAME, AGE, TRIAGE LEVEL AND SPECIALTY. IF ADMISSION IS REQUESTED, THE PROGRAM COLLECTS THE WARD AND NUMBER OF DAYS AND SCANS THE SELECTED WARD FROM ITS FIRST USABLE BED UNTIL IT FINDS A VALUE OF 0. THE SELECTED BED IS CHANGED TO 1. IF NO BED IS AVAILABLE, THE CODE CANCELS THE ADMISSION FOR THAT RECORD AND SETS THE ADMISSION-RELATED VALUES TO THEIR NON-ADMITTED STATE.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1186 0 R
>>
